+- [ ] Live blackout: manually add a 1-hour event in the connected calendar, refresh `/candidates`, confirm the slot generator excludes the window. **Pending sub-step 2.**
+- [ ] Live re-auth: `update therapy.therapist_profiles set gcal_authorized_at = now() - interval '8 days' where user_id = ...;` + reload page; confirm the re-auth banner appears and the connect flow restarts. **Pending sub-step 2.**
+- [ ] Live reschedule: PATCH an appointment to a new slot; verify the GCal event MOVES (same event_id, new times) instead of being recreated. **Pending sub-step 2.**
